1042df-b19e-4848-abfb-4bb7fdb86cfe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0562353a4ae85b6832eb6694bf381d3b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you!\n\nCould you please draw my original character?\nHe is an alien who is an assassin. He is a sniper.\nHe likes rock music, baking, sketching, and knives.\nHis personality is talkative, mischievous, somewhat crazy, and \"yandere\".\nHis themes include blood, knives, guns, and black wolves.\n\nA cool, dramatic action pose would be nice if possible! I will leave the pose and composition up to you.\n\nEither way, thank you for reading this!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1KMWnebYWR9qLmqqg6TmAzDJjJyxVEibY?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}